\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces Likelihood structure for the Type~I production scan. Panel~(a) shows $\Delta \chi ^2(\eta _{10},\Sigma _H)$ together with the standard joint-confidence contour levels. Panel~(b) shows the profile likelihood $\Delta \chi ^2_{\rm  prof}(\Sigma _H)$ and the 68\%, 95\%, and 99\% one-degree-of-freedom reference lines. The quoted production bound is extracted from the validated SciPy reference range and should not be extrapolated to the broader exploratory zone without further solver and closure validation.}}{39}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:chi2}{{15}{39}{Likelihood structure for the Type~I production scan. Panel~(a) shows $\Delta \chi ^2(\eta _{10},\Sigma _H)$ together with the standard joint-confidence contour levels. Panel~(b) shows the profile likelihood $\Delta \chi ^2_{\rm prof}(\Sigma _H)$ and the 68\%, 95\%, and 99\% one-degree-of-freedom reference lines. The quoted production bound is extracted from the validated SciPy reference range and should not be extrapolated to the broader exploratory zone without further solver and closure validation}{figure.caption.19}{}}
